228
00:13:35,332 --> 00:13:37,665
- me doy vuelta, ¿y qué encuentro?
- AirPods.

229
00:13:37,832 --> 00:13:39,123
- Sus AirPods. Vamos.
-¡Sus AirPods!

230
00:13:39,290 --> 00:13:40,207
Qué historia rara.

231
00:13:40,373 --> 00:13:42,748
- Siempre. Vamos.
- Siempre.

